    <briefdescription>
<para>Opaque device handle (definition), see <ref refid="structsi5332__t" kindref="compound">si5332_t</ref> in <ref refid="si5332_8h" kindref="compound">si5332.h</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds the HAL callbacks, the currently/requested clock source and the complete shadow state (channels + MultiSynths) together with dirty bitmasks that track which parts still need to be written to the device by <ref refid="si5332_8c_1a62c9756fc10566540267035a11c64c59" kindref="member">si5332_commit()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
